tweets.text:
Elon Musk on why giving money away well is so hard:

"It's very easy to give money away to get the appearance of goodness. It is very difficult to give money away for the reality of goodness."

@elonmusk on People by WTF with Nikhil Kamath. Video: Nikhil Kamath https://t.co/Uv7XMuR6Lt

tweets.text_zh:
埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 解释了为什么善待金钱如此困难：

“为了获得善良的外表而捐钱是很容易的，但为了获得善良的现实而捐钱是非常困难的。”

@elonmusk 与 Nikhil Kamath 共同发表 WTF 的《People》。视频：尼基尔·卡马斯 https://t.co/Uv7XMuR6Lt

